d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeons &amp; Raids with Guild Members</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947460/extras/c2a241af76e0b0d263973e7d2a60e91e.poster.avif?t=1772723479\" width=614 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947460/extras/c2a241af76e0b0d263973e7d2a60e91e.webm?t=1772723479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947460/extras/c2a241af76e0b0d263973e7d2a60e91e.mp4?t=1772723479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To return the developer to the real world, you must grow the village. Try battles with various party compositions. During simultaneous battles, party members will level up and earn equipment and gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful! What\u2019s scarier than bugs is the fragile mentality of a guild member who quits the game after a defeat! If you make your guild members and equipment strong enough in lower dungeons, it will greatly help protect their mentality from increasingly stronger monsters. If you lose a battle, analyze the battle log to find improvements and try again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade at the Auction House</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947460/extras/5a56ee3341bf902d2725f0e4d78ee558.poster.avif?t=1772723479\" width=614 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947460/extras/5a56ee3341bf902d2725f0e4d78ee558.webm?t=1772723479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947460/extras/5a56ee3341bf902d2725f0e4d78ee558.mp4?t=1772723479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Auction House is where you buy and sell the items you need. If you need something immediately, you can pay a high price to get it, or if you have time, you might grab an item someone urgently listed for less than half the price. Your choice will greatly affect how quickly you accumulate wealth. Wise trading is the shortcut to rapid growth. Sell items to visitors, from hundreds to thousands, and earn profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete the Codex</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947460/extras/7487b62627222de33fcebe65f6636b3d.poster.avif?t=1772723479\" width=614 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947460/extras/7487b62627222de33fcebe65f6636b3d.webm?t=1772723479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947460/extras/7487b62627222de33fcebe65f6636b3d.mp4?t=1772723479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Codex is divided into Alchemy, Cooking, Blacksmithing, and Enchanting, depending on the guild members\u2019 professions. Farming, Mining, and Fishing are also included. The higher the level, the more valuable the crafted items become, and the faster you can acquire resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to return the developer to the real world? We look forward to your story.</p>","developers":["Origin Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app